        <headline>Warning to Sheep Graziers for North East forecast district</headline>
        <description>Sheep graziers are warned that cold temperatures and southeasterly winds are expected during Monday. Areas likely to be affected include parts of the North East forecast district. There is a risk of losses of lambs and sheep exposed to these conditions.</description>
